#ShriAmarnathJiYatra2025
Traffic Advisory 

The yatris, travelling to seek blessings of Shri Amarnath ji, in their own/rented cars/buses or any other mode, are requested to travel in the main Yatra convoy only, starting from Bhagwati Nagar Jammu daily; in the interest of smooth and secure conduct of Shri Amarnath ji Yatra 2025.
